OL,3,GNEWSADuchess' garden has 'enormous'
OL,4,Aimpact in 25 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the longest-serving volunteers
OL,7,Fat a garden developed by the Duchess of
OL,8,FNorthumberland says it has had an
OL,9,F"enormous" impact on the local town, as
OL,10,Fit celebrates its 25th anniversary.
OL,12,FAlnwick Garden was opened in 2001 by
OL,13,FDuchess Jane Percy on formerly derelict
OL,14,Fland at Alnwick Castle, with the
OL,15,Fcharity that runs it hosting community
OL,16,Fprogrammes including a community
OL,17,Ffridge, Alzheimer's support group, and
OL,18,Fgardening schemes.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
