OL,3,GNEWSADuchess' garden has 'enormous'
OL,4,Aimpact in 25 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FSue Simpson, who joined during its
OL,7,Fconstruction in the 1990s and helps run
OL,8,Fa group to combat loneliness in elderly
OL,9,Fresidents, said the garden had become
OL,10,F"a whole part of being me".
OL,12,F"From the start, her Grace wanted it to
OL,13,Fbe our garden, and she maintained
OL,14,Fthat," she said.
